{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-10",
  "title": "鬼影如潮",
  "storyCode": "9-12",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "30e557148dc261c2c180f4feef02691a5467d11ad5763ae3e68fb938ca8ed52f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "大家都沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "多虧了您提醒，我們都及時躲起來了......咳咳咳，小簡妮，你呢，還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我很好，Outcast完全護住了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "只是外面......發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我聽到很多人在慘叫......還有孩子們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "簡，你還不能出去！所有人，繼續趴在掩體附近，盡可能遠離門窗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "這種規模的轟炸不會只有一波——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員弗雷德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊！我、我的腿......被書架壓住了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "威爾，幫弗雷德一把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "哈......謝謝，兄弟，我現在能動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "有沒有流血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "放心，只有一點點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "醫療包還在嗎？拿出急性感染前期阻斷劑，立刻服下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "啊？女士，我只是小腿上的皮被木頭劃破了一塊，連骨頭都沒傷到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "不，你錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "你現在正處於最高級別的感染風險中——看到那塊扎破窗戶的黑色結晶了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "天、天呐......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "......這是活性源石？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "難道說，街上那些黑漆漆的......全部都是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "恐怕是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我......我不敢相信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "這、這豈不是說全城都暴露在巨大的危險中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "該死！女士，我們必須儘快對附近的人們進行緊急救援！時間緊迫，能救一個是一個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "其他人有意見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員碎紙機",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "......我本來以為有意見的會是奧利弗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "都什麼時候了，你還挖苦我！趕緊去收拾急救包啊！弗雷德受傷了，原地待命，負責我們之間的聯絡！威爾，你趕緊回去看看你的父母——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "我也可以和大家一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "別糊塗了！工作有親人重要？帶上足量的藥，救完你家人，順便把你那一條街的鄰居都好好檢查一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員威爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "老大，謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "碎紙機，老朋友，我們得多跑幾條街了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "別忘了我，奧利弗，我現在也算你手下的臨時幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "女士，您別開玩笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "說正經的，第十區附近交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "那裡是轟炸中心，最危險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "不然呢？也請給我一個臨時通訊器，我們隨時互相通報進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "各位，我也想一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "呃，小簡妮，這救援任務不是開玩笑的，你不像我們這樣受過專業訓練，沒必要冒這險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "說到底，誰出的狠毒主意，往人堆裡丟活性源石？這都是那幫*維多利亞粗口*暴徒幹的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "能在極短時間內對這麼廣的區域狂轟濫炸，策劃這場襲擊的人，至少投入了超過十門最先進的地面壓制榴彈炮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "這麼多火炮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "我遠遠看過這兩天的戰鬥。那些被你們稱作暴徒的人，他們之中有著很強的術師，這給部隊帶來了一定隱匿能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "——可還遠遠沒到能讓他們帶著這麼多高殺傷性武器進城，且不被駐軍發現的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "更何況，他們還不至於蠢到用炮口對準好不容易搶下的城區，把當地居民連帶著自己人炸得支離破碎吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "您、您的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "簡，你知道答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "不，這不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "您是想說，我們的人炮轟了城區？！是我們......殺死了這麼多平民，還謀劃著將數量更多的平民拖入礦石病的深淵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "......是駐軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "駐軍明白這場仗贏不了，因為塔拉出身的人們都在幫另一邊。既然無法區分誰才是奸細，他們決定索性將敵人連同平民一網打盡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "而使用髒彈，正是為了絕後患。所有礦石病患者都會被集中管理，這給了駐軍藉口，他們之後將能堂而皇之地清理塔拉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "這是......把人命看作取勝的手段？維多利亞的軍隊，不該保護維多利亞人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "你很激動，我理解，這正是由於你擁有一顆許多士兵缺乏的仁慈之心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "過去幾百年間，維多利亞軍隊碾過這片大地上的無數國家與人群，靠的可從來不是仁慈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "難怪，在塔拉居民眼裡，暴徒們會是正義的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "都是只想著利用無辜者性命、為自己謀求利益的組織，不同花樣的面具下是同樣醜惡麻木的面孔，又有什麼區別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "那麼——是不是只有羅德島在做對的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "你有多麼瞭解羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我信任著奧利弗叔叔他們，而且，從我認識您的第一天起，我就一直信任著您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "你對我，又瞭解多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "女士，您何必這麼嚴肅，小簡妮她需要一點時間來接受......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......沒關係，奧利弗叔叔，我明白Outcast的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我確實......很感激你們收留了無處可去的我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "也確實，我仍在迷茫......每當我決定站在哪一邊的時候，總有人告訴我，我不屬於那一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "但至少在這一刻，我明白自己該做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "請讓我和你們一起行動。我要盡可能地幫助外面那些受傷的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "即使，他們中的一部分，剛剛還在朝你丟石頭、趕你走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "就跟您說的那樣，我始終無法對惡行袖手旁觀——這和我選擇站在哪裡沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "奧利弗，你聽到了？你是小丘郡辦事處的負責人，你同意簡·薇洛的臨時加入嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "我、我沒意見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "正好急救品都收拾好了，小簡妮，你想和誰一塊行動都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......我也去中央城區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "哈哈，那就是和Outcast女士一塊？呼，我還以為經過剛才那一齣，你會有些怕她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員奧利弗",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "我什麼都沒說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "既然準備好了，大家就各自出發吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "記住，保護自己是第一位的——你們既需要做好大面積污染源面前的防護，也需要儘量躲避潛在的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
      "text": "而且，以目前的情況來看，無論是哪方士兵，都有可能是我們的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "廚子先生，廚子先生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "唉，怎麼辦，到處都是傷患。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "不行，我一定要找到廚子先生，他應該就在這附近，我必須把他護送出城！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我......欸，什麼東西抓住了我的小腿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "是......敵人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "不，你已經喪失了行動能力。我不該再對你動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "......殺了......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "先別說話，我幫你把壓著腿的這塊石頭抬起來再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "嘿哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "好了！唉，都壓爛了啊，而且......這些黑色的結晶......看起來好嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "殺了......我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "我不能......感染者......骯髒......玷污！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "還說這種話做什麼？努力活下來不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "你......不懂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "這比死......更可怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "你說我不懂就不懂吧。我還要去找人，沒辦法救你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "廚子先生！廚子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "你又拉我做什麼？這......這條圍裙！廚子先生——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（這塊石頭，原來還壓在了廚子先生身上。難怪我沒能找到他。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（情報都還在。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（看得出來，最後一刻，廚子先生拼盡全力護住了這些重要的證據。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "麥克馬丁先生，雖然我也許並不知道您的真名——但我會記住您做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "安息吧，我的戰友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我不會讓你的英勇白費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "還有你。我也要謝謝你，不知名的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我本該答應你最後的請求，但我看得出來，不需要我動手，你已經快死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "你還有什麼話想說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "......領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "直到這時候，你心裡依舊只想著領袖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "哈......哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "我們......即將......迎來......新生之火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "你在看什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越來越多的敵人正踏著廢墟湧來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "敵人的援軍到了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "炮轟根本沒有起到正面作用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "隊長......隊長他們會有危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我必須和他們會合——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我的任務已經失敗了，那麼，我們唯一的機會就是奪下通訊基地台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
